{"analytics_identifier":null,"base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-safety-report-bajaj-almond-drops-hair-oil-2509-0229","content_id":"953b16f9-7197-407c-952a-781149ec181f","description":"Product Safety Report for Bajaj Almond Drops Hair Oil presenting a serious chemical risk. ","details":{"attachments":[{"attachment_type":"file","content_id":"985a1119-5b30-4721-baca-c577660b5cb1","content_type":"application/pdf","created_at":"2026-01-09T10:41:14+00:00","id":"985a1119-5b30-4721-baca-c577660b5cb1","title":"Link to Product Image and PDF","updated_at":"2026-01-09T10:41:14+00:00","url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6960db49563214050908699f/2509-0229-product-safety-report-bajaj-almond-drops.pdf"}],"body":"<h2 id=\"summary\">Summary</h2>\n\n<p>Product: Bajaj Almond Drops Hair Oil</p>\n\n<p>Hazard: The product presents a serious chemical risk as it contains butylphenyl methylpropional (BMHCA), which is prohibited for use in cosmetic products.</p>\n\n<p>Corrective action:  The product has been seized from the distributor and destroyed.</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"product-information\">Product information</h2>\n\n<table>\n  <thead>\n    <tr>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Type</th>\n      <th scope=\"col\">Cosmetics, personal care and grooming - Hair - Conditioner/Treatment</th>\n    </tr>\n  </thead>\n  <tbody>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Brand</td>\n      <td>Bajaj</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Barcode</td>\n      <td>8906014765251</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Country of Origin</td>\n      <td>India</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Description</td>\n      <td>Gold-coloured hair oil in a 200ml bottle.</td>\n    </tr>\n    <tr>\n      <td>Product Report and Image</td>\n      <td><span id=\"attachment_985a1119-5b30-4721-baca-c577660b5cb1\" class=\"attachment-inline\"><a href=\"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6960db49563214050908699f/2509-0229-product-safety-report-bajaj-almond-drops.pdf\">Link to Product Image and PDF</a></span></td>\n    </tr>\n  </tbody>\n</table>\n\n<h2 id=\"hazard\">Hazard</h2>\n\n<p>The product presents a serious chemical risk as it contains butylphenyl methylpropional, also known as lilial or BMHCA. Butylphenyl methylpropional is not permitted in cosmetic products as it may harm the reproductive system or the health of the unborn child and may cause skin sensitisation. </p>\n\n<p>The product does not meet the requirements of Regulation (EC) 1223/2009 (‘The Cosmetics Regulation’).</p>\n\n<h2 id=\"corrective-action\">Corrective action</h2>\n\n<p>The product has been seized from the distributor and destroyed.</p>\n\n<h3 id=\"additional-information\">Additional information</h3>\n\n<p>PSD notification number: 2509-0229</p>\n\n<p>Notified by: Local Authority Trading Standards</p>\n","change_history":[{"note":"First published.","public_timestamp":"2026-01-09T10:42:25Z"}],"headers":[{"id":"summary","level":2,"text":"Summary"},{"id":"product-information","level":2,"text":"Product information"},{"id":"hazard","level":2,"text":"Hazard"},{"headers":[{"id":"additional-information","level":3,"text":"Additional information"}],"id":"corrective-action","level":2,"text":"Corrective action"}],"max_cache_time":10,"metadata":{"product_alert_type":"product-safety-report","product_category":"cosmetics","product_measure_type":["destruction-of-the-product","other"],"product_recall_alert_date":"2026-01-09","product_risk_level":"serious"},"temporary_update_type":false},"document_type":"product_safety_alert_report_recall","first_published_at":"2026-01-09T10:42:25+00:00","links":{"available_translations":[{"api_path":"/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-safety-report-bajaj-almond-drops-hair-oil-2509-0229","api_url":"https://www.gov.uk/api/content/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-safety-report-bajaj-almond-drops-hair-oil-2509-0229","base_path":"/product-safety-alerts-reports-recalls/product-safety-report-bajaj-almond-drops-hair-oil-2509-0229","content_i